### 5. UOutputOrder.cs - DA TIM THAY

**Duong dan:** `g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\-vat-tuquangbin\StockManager\Order\Output\UOutputOrder.cs`

Noi dung day du file da duoc doc o tren. File nay la UserControl dung de hien thi/chon thong tin **Yeu cau xuat (OutputOrder)** gom:

- **Properties:** `OutputOrderID`, `Status`, `DepartmentID`, `OutputOrderCode`, `OutputOrderName`, ...
- **Phuong thuc `LoadOutputOrderInfo`** (dong 144-239): Load thong tin yeu cau xuat tu database hoac tu form chon
- **Phuong thuc `Reset`** (dong 244-249): Reset cac gia tri ve mac dinh
- **Phuong thuc `IsValidData`** (dong 253-263): Kiem tra du lieu dau vao

